    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara is pleased to present to the market 32 Frankfort Avenue. And attractive mid terrace red brick residence set in spacious gardens with laneway access to rear. \r\n\r\nPresently sub divided into 4 units and ideally suited restoration to a family home or home/income. \r\n\r\nExtended to rear and well maintained throughout the accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway with utility off. 1 bedroom flat at hall level, 2 bedroom flat at return level, 1 bedroom flat at first floor return and 2 bedroom flat at first floor level. \r\n\r\nOutside are front and rear gardens, studio, storage shed and access to laneway. \r\n\r\nEnviable location beside local shops on Upper Rathmines Road and the villages of Rathgar and Rathmines are also within close proximity with their wide selection of shops, restaurants, cinemas, bars etc. Amenities in the area are in abundance with Palmerston Park and a number of sporting clubs. Some of Dublin`s finest schools are closeby including Alexandra College, Gonzaga, St. Marys, Kildare Place N.S, Rathgar Junior and N.S to name a few. Frankfort Avenue is also within walking distance to the LUAS and a number of bus routes linking into the city centre and further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nCeiling coving and closet. \r\n\r\nUtility \r\nPlumbed for washing machine. \r\n\r\nFlat 1 \r\nLiving/Kitchen\r\nFitted units and ceiling coving. \r\n\r\nBedroom \r\nFitted wardrobe, ceiling coving. \r\nEnsuite \r\nShower, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\nReturn \r\nFlat 2 \r\nLiving/Kitchen\r\nFitted units \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nShower room\r\nShower, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\n1st floor return \r\nFlat 3\r\nLiving/Kitchen\r\nFitted units.\r\n\r\nBedroom \r\nEnsuite \r\nShower, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\n1st floor\r\nFlat 4\r\nLiving/Kitchen\r\nFitted units \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobe. \r\n\r\nShower room\r\nShower, w.c and whb. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nRailed front garden with mature hedging. Walled rear garden with studio, outside storage and door to laneway."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "GFCH\r\nDouble glazed\r\nLaneway access \r\nPeriod residence \r\nBeside local shops on Upper Rathmines Road\r\nNumber of primary and secondary schools in the area\r\nNumerous bus routes and LUAS closeby\r\nWalking distance of the villages of Rathgar and Rathmines \r\nConvenient to Dodder Linear Park and Palmerston Park \r\nM50 within easy reach"
